Ochre jellies are yellow, boneless oozes that lash out with limbs of themselves and hold what they catch. A blade cuts into one and it comes apart into two, and what is killed melts down to a puddle of water. They can throw a wash of acid over a room and lay a curse that ages a person for a moment. The one at the sewage works in the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sewers|royal waterways]] left [[People/Johnny|Johnny]] with a gray hair.
